`bing-maps` offers powerful mapping and traffic visualization capabilities essential for displaying interactive route and traffic incident data. `bbc-nitro`, while primarily content-related, is the closest available API from BBC that may provide structured access to relevant feeds or meta content. Since no direct Highways Agency API is present, RSS feed integration can be implemented separately. Other traffic APIs like `yahoo-traffic` and `bing-traffic` focus on North America, so they are not ideal for a UK-only application. `webhoseio` is more general for news and may be supplementary but is not a primary API recommendation.
